 small Godot project which reproduces the issue, with no unnecessary files included. Be sure to not include the `.godot` folder in the archive (but keep `project.godot`).\n- Having an MRP is very important for contributors to be able to reproduce the bug in the same way that you are experiencing it. When testing a potential fix for the issue, contributors will use the MRP to validate that the fix is working as intended.\n- Drag and drop a ZIP archive to upload it (max 10 MB). **Do not select another field until the project is done uploading.**\n- **Note for C# users:** If your issue is *not* C#-specific, please upload a minimal reproduction project written in GDScript. This will make it easier for contributors to reproduce the issue locally as not everyone has a .NET setup available. ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2745281740/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2745300225","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104483#issuecomment-2745300225","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104483","id":2745300225,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6jofUB","user":{"login":"Mordilla-Software","id":133614128,"node_id":"U_kgDOB_bKMA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/133614128?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mordilla-Software","html_url":"https://github.com/Mordilla-Software","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mordilla-Software/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mordilla-Software/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mordilla-Software/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mordilla-Software/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"http